          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A witness observed on August 24, 2010 at 1:30 AM a luminous phenomenon in the sky that intrigued them. The described characteristics correspond to those of a known phenomenon (observation of a planet) and the observation presents no strangeness. The presence of planet Jupiter in the sky area at the date and time of the observation, along with characteristic photos, strongly validate this hypothesis. Although the testimony is unique, it is of good quality, well-detailed, considering different hypotheses, and provides good consistency to the case. The case is classified A as explained by the observation of planet Jupiter.",
